I'm going to use functions.execute to run a SPARQL SELECT query with the subject being a film and looking for the director information using dbo:director or dbp:director. I also think it's a good idea to include rdfs:label for the director.  

The constructed SPARQL will be: 

SELECT ?director ?directorLabel WHERE { 
  dbr:Hurricane_at_Pilgrim_Hill dbo:director ?director . 
  OPTIONAL { 
    ?director rdfs:label ?directorLabel . 
    FILTER (lang(?directorLabel) = 'en') 
  } 
}  

